title Spike 16: containers
about Storage that moves. Blue.0's store is full, so its income fills three container trucks; it gives them to blue.1 (watch blue.1's energy jump), who drives them forward and digs them in as vaults, cargo and all. 4 minutes at 8x.

scenario economy
players blue 2
clip 0..7200
speed 8
camera 150,256 220
bot blue.0 off                       # blue.0 is a person: the script plays it

at 0 spawn blue.0 generator 8 at 40,200 radius 14

at 1200 select blue factory as plant
at 1201 produce plant container 3

at 4800 select blue container as trucks
at 4801 give trucks to 1
at 4802 select blue.1 container as theirs  # blue.1's now: only blue.1 orders them
at 4830 move theirs 180,256
at 5700 give blue.0 metal 600 to 1    # digging in costs metal, and blue.1's bot spends all it has
at 5701 entrench theirs

# Observed: before the give, blue.0 has 25,000 energy (its 10,000 and three
# full trucks), blue.1 10,000; just after, blue.0 10,000 and blue.1 about
# 25,000. By 6500 all three are vaults, still holding their energy.
at 4799 expect blue.0 energy >= 24000
at 4799 expect blue.0 containers == 3
at 4803 expect blue.0 energy <= 10000
at 4803 expect blue.1 energy >= 24000
at 4803 expect blue.1 containers == 3
at 6500 expect blue.1 vaults == 3
at 6500 expect blue.1 energy > 10000
at 6600 select blue.1 vault within 25 of 180,256 as dug
at 6601 expect dug alive == 3          # dug in where blue.1 drove them
